      "title": "09｜湖边大夜怪｜夜雾横推本体｜完整提示词",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "How the reference pictures align with the target video — Picture 1 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 0.00-second mark of the target video; Picture 2 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 8.00-second mark of the target video.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] A fixed-camera eight-second 2D sprite clip. One asymmetrical grey-lavender cloud, exactly one sleepy cream face at lower-left, two ivory horns, the original dusty-rose mound and exactly three small grey puffs on the right. Entirely legless with a continuous rounded underside. All three existing puffs remain close to the body.\n\n0.00-1.00s: the exact quiet source pose. 1.00-1.65s: ONLY the connected GREY outer chest lobes on the screen-left side extend a tiny distance, at most 3 percent of body width. The cream face patch, eyes, nose, head, horns, rose mound and all three right-side puffs retain their exact original size and shape. 1.65-1.90s: a single small ripple travels through those same grey outer lobes toward screen-left, and the grey outline returns. The facial plane stays rigid and completely unchanged, with neutral sleepy eyes. 1.90-8.00s: source idle, with only very small breathing and tiny local motions of the same three puffs. Every existing part stays attached or at its source spacing. The outside background is only a completely flat single green color, with no other visible mark.\n\nThe supplied left-facing three-quarter sprite remains at the same size and fixed canvas center, with its face and body both directed toward screen-left. Keep the source near-side/far-side occlusion and exact painted colors, texture and part counts. The camera and viewing angle are completely fixed. Only the stated small local motions occur. The entire area outside this one sprite is a completely flat, opaque, uniformly lit chroma-green color #00FF00 in EVERY frame, identical to the reference background. All empty background pixels stay the same solid green throughout; it remains an empty color field with constant exposure. Keep all existing parts connected and preserve the original anatomy. All motion ends in the supplied neutral pose; the body and face keep their left-facing three-quarter orientation throughout.\n\noverall_soundscape: N/A\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\n"
      ],
